# Function arity warning: a 2-parameter lambda is checked against Fn(Int)->Int
# (a 1-parameter function type). The type checker reports "arity mismatch".
# At runtime, the TypeAssert only checks that the value is a Function (not the arity),
# so eval returns the function successfully.
[@[Fn@Int [Int]] [fn [x y] x]]
=== out
Function(x, y)
=== warn
arity mismatch
